\end{table}

\paragraph{Within-family DIF (confound control).}
Table~\ref{tab:family} reports within-family DIF, controlling for training data lineage.
Llama-2 vs.\ Llama-3 shows 61.3\% C items, consistent with the large generation gap ($d \approx -0.99$); Mistral vs.\ Mixtral shows 38.7\%, reflecting architectural differences.

